msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Taxi's probably the quickest way to the airport. The roads\r\n"
"should be clear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Right. Thanks, Date-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Be careful down there, Kiryu. For a small island, there are sure gonna be a "
"lot of people there who wanna mess you up. The Hakuho, the CIA... Just stay "
"safe, will you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "I'll do my best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Dammit. Looks like getting down to Okinawa's not gonna be as\r\n"
"easy as we thought, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "We? Sorry, Date-san... but I need to do this alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"But Mine's gonna have an army of guys down there. Going\r\n"
"without any backup is like signing your own damn death wish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Man's got a point, Kiryu-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Ya ask me, we send in some of my boys, rough some people up,\r\n"
"make sure nobody even thinks of layin' a hand on ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Look, I'll be fine on my own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Why are you being so stubborn about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"The only reason I've gotten this far involved is so I can\r\n"
"make sure Morning Glory is safe. I care about Daigo and the\r\n"
"Tojo Clan, yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "But when push comes to shove, this Okinawa fight is mine and mine alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Not anymore it ain't. Not with the CIA and those Hakuho\r\n"
"thugs turnin' the place all topsy-turvy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "It'll be okay. I have friends down there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "The Ryudo Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"If I'm gonna be settling a fight in Okinawa, I want to do it\r\n"
"with Okinawa natives by my side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "...Oh. And you're sure about that, Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "One hundred percent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "S'pose that's that, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "So, what? You're just giving up, Majima?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-chan's a big, stubborn ox. No changin' his mind when\r\n"
"he's like this, Date-san. Ya should know that better than anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Even so, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-chan. The Majima Family'll keep the lights on over at\r\n"
"Tojo HQ while you're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Go do what you gotta do, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "...Thank you, Majima-san."
msgstr ""

